 we can also keep the push to main if we want, but we don't have to.\\n\\n However, the issue says the workflow should run on every push and pull request. But the base branch is not main.\\n\\n We'll change the workflow to trigger on pull requests to the base branch and also on pushes to the base branch? But we are not pushing to the base branch.\\n\\n We'll change it to:\\n\\n   on:\\n     push:\\n       branches: [ e2e/hello-world/39118680544/agent-nemotron-3-super-free ]\\n     pull_request:\\n       branches: [ e2e/hello-world/39118680544/agent-nemotron-3-super-free ]\\n\\n But note: we are not allowed to push to the base branch? We can, but we don't want to.\\n\\n We'll keep the push to the base branch for completeness.\\n\\n Let's update the workflow file.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]}}",
